# {{.AppName}}

Scaffolded with [fxkit](https://github.com/fitan/fxkit).

## Run

```bash
# Stand-alone (no Dapr)
make run

# With Dapr sidecar (in-memory state + pubsub by default)
make dapr-run
```

Visit:

- `GET  /greet/{name}` — sample JSON handler (chi)
- `GET  /docs`         — Scalar API reference
- `GET  /openapi.yaml` — embedded OpenAPI skeleton (extend with Buf when you add RPCs)
- `GET  /healthz`      — liveness

Trigger the pub/sub subscriber:

```bash
curl -X POST "http://localhost:3501/v1.0/publish/pubsub/orders" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{"id":1}'
```

## Add a service

```bash
mkdir -p internal/users
# write internal/users/users.go with fx.Module that uses
# server.ProvideRoutes / daprx.ProvideTopics / etc.
```

Then mount it in `cmd/main.go`:

```go
fxkit.Run(
    fxkit.Default(),
    hello.Module,
    users.Module,
)
```

## Config

`configs/config.yaml` controls the framework. Use [Config.Viper] or
`UnmarshalKey` to load your own sections (see fxkit docs).
